Rhineland-Palatinate DGM1
Hesse DGM1
Brandenburg DGM1
Lower Saxony DGM1
Emilia-Romagna coast DTM
South Tyrol DTM
Luxembourg LiDAR DTM
Netherlands AHN DTM
swissALTI3D
France IGN (LiDAR HD + RGE ALTI)
Scotland LiDAR DTM
Wales LiDAR DTM
England LiDAR composite DTM
Poland NMT
Czechia DMR 5G
Norway DTM1
Estonia DTM 5 m
Tasmania 2 m DEM
Copernicus GLO-30 (surface model)</item>
